  "title": "Grandma Carol&#39;s Pumpkin Roll",
  "description": "Grandma Carol&#39;s pumpkin roll recipe makes a spiced pumpkin rollade cake stuffed with a sweet, delicious cream cheese filling, perfect for the holidays.",
  "authors": [
    "SusieQ"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:51:39-04:00",
