  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.66666668653488 cup pumpkin puree",
    "3 eggs, beaten",
    "0.75 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1 (16 ounce) package confectioners' sugar",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup chopped pecans",
    "2 teaspoons confectioners' sugar for dusting, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Grease a 12x17-inch jelly roll pan and line with parchment paper; grease the parchment paper. Generously dust a large kitchen towel with confectioners' sugar. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kv2Gj3Aq1uL-ixEC0jndF_C6MdI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-01-4deb09b63b0d4a42986a66002f0c4da2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat white sugar, pumpkin, and eggs together in a large bowl until creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kq3YwhRJwzFaVN_4jka4z-pEPhE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-02-743e39edc3474a23ae841308602d9cdf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking soda, cinnamon, cloves, and nutmeg together in a medium bowl; gradually stir into egg mixture until well combined. Spread batter evenly in the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TYYJZ2dHeGuvfoJZ-FPTbWigibA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-03-02016d6cc7d748988155e30fcfeff6fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XHpj-3Ra8LMZu30WMwk50Rh4QgY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-04-7cc740132bb04192a615b2a0abd8e17c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immediately turn cake onto the prepared kitchen towel. Starting at a long end, roll up pumpkin cake and towel. Let rolled cake rest for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8kpcesXfwp4BlH36aCDGXWQGhlI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-06-77cb48d57a024bf1b28745d2dfad945e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat 16-ounce package confectioners' sugar, cream cheese, butter, and vanilla extract together in a large bowl until smooth; fold in pecans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P2WAuBOT9-kWFa_Y92q3AFT5_iU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-05-c0ef5c64c9de4cfa9feb5b5c7600cd6a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unroll cake; spread evenly with filling. Roll up cake (without towel). Cut off jagged ends. Cover and refrigerate until chilled.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bQDRpy1ZRt-S-hunnOM2OyPsXEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-07-85884dfab56d49be85f8d43c92a03ffe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut cake in half; sprinkle with confectioners' sugar before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HjKabM_5jsq1koj1m0a2mJ24y5s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229424-grandma-carols-pumpkin-roll-VAT-step-08-a7be93db5c574879acaab14f72fcc44b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229424/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
